    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve block sliding puzzles with 5 lovely companions!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brainteasing block puzzles have never looked so inviting! In Moe Waifu H Push-Box, you\u2019ll meet 5 female companions who will test your problem-solving skills and reward your cleverness. Navigate colorful seasonally themed stages in top-down style as you push crates onto designated tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532560/extras/d06a3bbb787acbdeab189225b02e4517.poster.avif?t=1746794043\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532560/extras/d06a3bbb787acbdeab189225b02e4517.webm?t=1746794043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532560/extras/d06a3bbb787acbdeab189225b02e4517.mp4?t=1746794043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with 15 unique stages to master, you will also unlock gallery images and jukebox sounds as you progress, giving you plenty of reasons to keep coming back for more quality time with your favorite waifu!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532560/extras/5bff7ca0eb34167e8256655f5f017fa9.poster.avif?t=1746794043\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532560/extras/5bff7ca0eb34167e8256655f5f017fa9.webm?t=1746794043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532560/extras/5bff7ca0eb34167e8256655f5f017fa9.mp4?t=1746794043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 15 unique brainteasing stages!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide crates and carefully arrange them on the glowing tiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new seasonally themed levels of increasing complexity!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet 5 lovely companion characters and impress them with your intellect!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the clock and strategically use lightning bolts to restart levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn jukebox sounds and fill your gallery with new images!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve block sliding puzzles with 5 lovely companions!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brainteasing block puzzles have never looked so inviting! In Moe Waifu H Push-Box, you\u2019ll meet 5 female companions who will test your problem-solving skills and reward your cleverness. Navigate colorful seasonally themed stages in top-down style as you push crates onto designated tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532560/extras/d06a3bbb787acbdeab189225b02e4517.poster.avif?t=1746794043\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532560/extras/d06a3bbb787acbdeab189225b02e4517.webm?t=1746794043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532560/extras/d06a3bbb787acbdeab189225b02e4517.mp4?t=1746794043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with 15 unique stages to master, you will also unlock gallery images and jukebox sounds as you progress, giving you plenty of reasons to keep coming back for more quality time with your favorite waifu!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532560/extras/5bff7ca0eb34167e8256655f5f017fa9.poster.avif?t=1746794043\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532560/extras/5bff7ca0eb34167e8256655f5f017fa9.webm?t=1746794043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532560/extras/5bff7ca0eb34167e8256655f5f017fa9.mp4?t=1746794043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"b